TITLE 100C pure water pH 3 eq with minerals; compute specific conductance
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica         0 10
    Kaolinite      0 10
    Dolomite       0 10
    Epsomite       0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a)     0 10
    Halite         0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC_uS_per_cm
10 PUNCH SC
END
